msgid ""
"Approving gives this device access to your profile and saved source logins."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Backup file may contain sensitive information. Do you want to set a password?"
msgstr ""
"Rezerves kopijas failā var būt sensitīva informācija. Vai vēlaties iestatīt "
"paroli?"

msgid ""
"Backup restored with {entries} skipped playlist entries and {listens} "
"skipped listens."
msgstr ""
"Rezerves kopija atjaunota, izlaižot {entries} atskaņošanas saraksta "
"ierakstus un {listens} atskaņošanas reizes."

msgid ""
"Choose where this device stores local music received through Connect. "
"Matching files already in the folder are reused; missing files are "
"downloaded here."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Connecting an existing profile will remove all data in this device, do you "
"really want to continue?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Devices using Rufin Connect are no longer compatible. Please update Rufin."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Downloads from this server will be removed, and automatic rules will be "
"turned off"
msgstr ""
"Lejupielādes no šī servera tiks dzēstas un automātiskās funkcijas tiks "
"atslēgtas"

msgid ""
"If Discord is not installed as a flatpak, you need to give socket access to "
"Rufin. If it is installed as a flatpak, this is not needed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"List shared folders on this server using the entered credentials or guest "
"access"
msgstr ""
"Rādīt koplietoto mapi šajā serverī, izmantojot norādītos autentifikācijas "
"datus vai viesrežīmu"

msgid ""
"Logs have secrets and absolute folder paths redacted, but you may still want "
"to review the logs before sharing them"
msgstr ""
"Žurnālos sensitīva informācija un absolūtie ceļi uz mapēm ir aizvietoti, "
"taču pirms žurnālu koplietošanas varat vēlēties tos pārskatīt"

msgid "No results ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"
msgstr "Rezultāti netika atrasti ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"

msgid ""
"No secret service found. Rufin will use a file to store its credentials. "
"Cancelling will not save credentials at all."
msgstr ""
"Nav atrasts slepens serviss. Rufin izmantos failu, lai saglabātu savus "
"autentifikācijas datus. Atcelšana neatgriezīs autentifikācijas datus."

msgid ""
"Only downloads from this rule will be deleted. Shared and manual downloads "
"stay"
msgstr ""
"Tikai šī noteikuma ietvarā lejupielādētie faili tiks dzēsti. Koplietotie un "
"manuāli lejupielādētie faili paliks"

msgid ""
"Open Rufin Connect on another device, connect via Join button or by copying "
"invitation code"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Remove Local and its cached library from Rufin? Your music files will not be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Dzēst lokālās mūzikas failus un to kešēto bibliotēku no Rufin? Jūsu mūzikas "
"faili netiks dzēsti."

msgid ""
"Replace the selected contents and remove these configured sources?\n"
"{sources}\n"
"Their retained user state and saved logins will remain unless selected."
msgstr ""
"Aizvietot atlasīto saturu un noņemt šos konfigurētos avotus?\n"
"{sources}\n"
"To saglabātā lietotāja informācija un saglabātie pieteikšanās dati paliks "
"nemainīgi, ja vien tos neatceļat."

msgid ""
"Replace the selected contents with this backup? Local folder permissions may "
"need to be selected again."
msgstr ""
"Aizstāt atlasīto saturu ar šo rezerves kopiju? Var būt nepieciešams vēlreiz "
"iestatīt lokālās mapes atļaujas."

msgid ""
"Route server media through this device instead of sharing provider URLs with "
"the renderer"
msgstr ""
"Novirzēt servera multivides datus caur šo ierīci, nevis daliīties ar "
"atskaņotāja URL adresēm"

msgid ""
"Rufin started with fresh user state because the saved database could not be "
"used. Your settings and saved logins are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Rufin tika palaists ar jaunu lietotāja stāvokli, jo saglabāto datubāzi "
"nevarēja izmantot. Jūsu iestatījumi un saglabātie pieteikšanās dati nav "
"mainīti."

msgid ""
"Rufin will calculate the missing EBU R128 metadata for the whole library. "
"This can use significant CPU, battery, and network bandwidth for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Rufin aprēķinās trūkstošos EBU R128 metadatus visai mūzikas bibliotēkai. Tas "
"var ievērojami noslogot procesoru, patērēt akumulatora enerģiju un izmantot "
"lielu daudzumu tīkla resursu ilgā laika periodā."

msgid ""
"Temporary library storage is in use. Changes may be lost when Rufin closes."
msgstr ""
"Pašlaik tiek izmantota pagaidu bibliotēkas krātuve. Aizverot Rufin, izmaiņas "
"var tikt zaudētas."

msgid ""
"Thank you for trying out Rufin! If you have problems or suggestions, please "
"open an issue in Github."
msgstr ""
"Paldies, ka izmēģināt Rufin! Ja jums ir problēmas vai ierosinājumi, lūdzu, "
"atveriet problēmu vietnē Github."

msgid ""
"The folder is relative to the selected account. Applying it changes storage "
"on all devices."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"These folders are combined into the Local source and shown through folder "
"browsing"
msgstr ""
"Šīs mapes tiek apvienotas vienā lokālā avotā un parādītas, pārlūkojot mapes"

msgid ""
"This is not supported natively by this source, but Rufin can show partial "
"stars and then round them up for the source"
msgstr ""
"Šis avots to neatbalsta, taču Rufin var rādīt daļējas zvaigznes un pēc tam "
"noapaļot tās šim avotam"

msgid ""
"This is owned by Rufin. It can include entries from all configured sources "
"but it is not synced to remotes."
msgstr ""
"Šī ir Rufin īpašumā. Tajā var iekļaut ierakstus no visiem konfigurētajiem "
"avotiem, taču tā netiek sinhronizēta ar attālajām ierīcēm."

msgid ""
"This only takes affect for new local files that are added by another device"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This removes the server, cached library metadata, queue snapshot, and saved "
"token for"
msgstr ""
"Tas noņem serveri, kešotos bibliotēkas metadatus, rindas momentuzņēmumu un "
"saglabāto žetonu priekš"

msgid ""
"This will log you out and clear your secrets including API ones. Your app "
"cache is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Šī darbība izrakstinās jūs un dzēsīs jūsu sensitīvos datus, ieskaitot API "
"atslēgas. Jūsu lietotnes kešatmiņa netiks skarta."

msgid ""
"This will overwrite your lyrics file with what Rufin fetched, it may be a "
"better experience to use a dedicated program or plugin to fetch lyrics "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Šis pārrakstīs jūsu tekstu failu ar datiem, ko Rufin ir lejupielādējis. "
"Iespējams, labāk izmantot atsevišķu programmu vai papildinājumu tekstu "
"lejupielādei."

msgid ""
"Track evens out every song, while Album preserves the intended differences "
"within each album"
msgstr ""
"Celiņš” izlīdzina skaņas līmeni visās dziesmās, savukārt Albums” saglabā "
"paredzētās atšķirības katrā albumā"

msgid ""
"You will need to reconnect through the clients you use with the new API key."
msgstr ""
"Jums būs jāatjauno savienojums, izmantojot jaunās API atslēgas, klientu "
"lietojumprogrammās, kuras izmantojat."

msgid ". You only need to fill email and an application name parts"
msgstr ". Jums jāaizpilda tikai e-pasta un lietojumprogrammas nosaukuma daļas"

